        <message_html><![CDATA[<p data-end="178" data-start="168"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Bonjour ${opened_by.first_name} ${opened_by.last_name},</span></p>
<p data-end="277" data-start="180">&nbsp;</p>
<p data-end="277" data-start="180"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Votre demande de cr&eacute;ation d&rsquo;un nouveau risque a bien &eacute;t&eacute; soumise et est en cours de traitement.</span></p>
<p data-end="400" data-start="279"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Un responsable examinera votre demande et vous serez inform&eacute;(e) de la d&eacute;cision (acceptation ou refus) par notification.</span></p>
<p data-end="431" data-start="402"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">D&eacute;tails de la demande :</span></p>
<p data-end="431" data-start="402">&nbsp;</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
<li style="font-size: 12pt;" data-end="468" data-start="434"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Num&eacute;ro de la demande</strong> : ${number}</span></li>
<li style="font-size: 12pt;" data-end="468" data-start="434"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span title="" data-original-title="" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="right"><strong>Type de risque</strong> : ${risk_type}</span></span></li>
<li style="font-size: 12pt;" data-end="468" data-start="434"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Nom propos&eacute; pour le risque</strong> :&nbsp; ${name}</span></li>
<li style="font-size: 12pt;" data-end="468" data-start="434"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Description du risque </strong>: ${description}</span></li>
<li style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><label for="sp_formfield_asset_activity_affected_by_this_risk"><strong>Actif ou activit&eacute; concern&eacute; par ce risque </strong>: ${asset_activity_affected_by_this_risk}&nbsp;</label></span></li>
<li style="font-size: 12pt;" data-end="468" data-start="434"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Soumis par </strong>: ${opened_by}</span></li>
<li style="font-size: 12pt;" data-end="468" data-start="434"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Date de soumission </strong>: ${sys_created_on}</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</p>
<p data-end="619" data-start="586"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Si vous souhaitez ajouter des commentaires ou suivre l&rsquo;avancement de votre demande, vous pouvez la consulter en suivant ce lien : ${mail_script:energir_url_risk_portal}</span></p>
<p data-end="619" data-start="586">&nbsp;</p>
<p data-end="619" data-start="586"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Merci pour votre collaboration.</span></p>
<p data-end="619" data-start="586">&nbsp;</p>
<p data-end="651" data-start="621"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Cordialement,</span><br data-end="637" data-start="634"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">L&rsquo;&eacute;quipe SGSOP</span></p>]]></message_html>
